Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.08,0:00:22.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you see the season's new anime?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will you keep watching?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.64,0:00:28.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not this game.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.39,Text A,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,1010)\fad(200,200)}Five in a row - Laozi wins
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.74,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Clearly, I am no match for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.76,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the game, Emperor Yan.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.25,0:00:37.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.29,0:00:39.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the Sky Pearl was stolen?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.29,0:00:54.19,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your spirit parts?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've sent them up the hill.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.57,0:00:57.41,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't we go there now?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:00.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The nearby hills are not suitable for Piyu.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.11,0:01:01.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today we will go deeper.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.61,0:01:09.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.64,0:01:16.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.62,0:01:17.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.15,0:01:22.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where will we release him?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In a place with no people.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.28,0:01:26.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't other animals hurt him?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.70,0:01:30.15,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Xiaohei is the only one who can catch him.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.78,0:01:34.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't Piyu fond of wood?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.76,0:01:36.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he eats up the whole forest?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trees too are living things.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They become wood when they die.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.79,0:01:41.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu won't eat living trees.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.00,0:01:46.17,Episode title 8,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\pos(1530,340)}Deep in the Mountains
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.16,0:01:48.71,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, today's weather.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.30,0:01:51.52,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Typhoon "Show Joy" is approaching the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.52,0:01:52.92,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure to take the laundry in!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.67,0:01:54.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.06,0:01:55.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When exactly?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.56,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is not confirmed as of now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.11,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most likely in two episodes' time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.11,0:02:00.86,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I go tell the other households.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.17,0:02:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The kids better hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.57,0:02:10.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From here we have to go by foot.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.93,0:02:24.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.34,0:02:32.66,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Looks like no one's been around here for a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.91,0:02:35.60,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this has been Grandpa's wood gathering trail.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.82,0:02:40.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So many fairies!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not shy of me!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.16,0:02:54.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The villagers don't hurt them, do they?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.94,0:02:59.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are getting along with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.78,0:03:06.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.88,0:03:12.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beyond this rock lies their world.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't go any further.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a huge rock...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who put it here?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.71,0:03:20.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.69,0:03:23.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.57,0:03:26.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't go in there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.90,0:03:28.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.46,0:03:34.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are free now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go to people's houses again!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.13,0:03:38.98,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.43,0:03:40.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't go...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.66,0:03:42.80,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Race to the top?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.80,0:03:43.44,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.47,0:03:52.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why... Why are you crying now?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't he be lonely in the forest?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.05,0:04:25.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he'll be starving?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.01,0:04:27.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't happen.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will he think about us sometimes?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.98,0:04:34.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The sky turned quite dark...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The forecast said a big rainfall is coming.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't Piyu be in danger?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.66,0:05:17.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be alright.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.14,0:05:20.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.86,0:05:21.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take Xiaobai in the house!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.77,0:05:25.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you feel it too?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.79,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A strong spirit aura...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.70,0:05:38.56,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting...?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.83,0:05:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.05,0:05:42.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it's a spirit.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.01,0:05:45.61,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight me?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.13,0:05:51.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighting!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.41,0:05:53.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am the king of fighting!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will be back!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you find this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.81,0:06:03.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've simply followed the strongest aura around.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.67,0:06:07.26,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange... Xiaohei's aura must be quite weak now...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.18,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(684,600)}The strongest\Naround
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.18,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\fnAlegreya Sans Black\fs88\pos(718,586)}↗
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.22,0:06:09.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hand the Pearl over, right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't do it right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.06,0:06:11.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because the episode is over.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.17,0:07:07.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see I'm no match for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give up the Pearl!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've told you already.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ask Master Lao, he knows it all.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.17,0:07:14.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would I trust you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get him?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.43,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.50,Episode title 9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1526,502)}Diting
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was before you became the master's disciple.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can't trust me, I'll go to him with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.62,0:07:24.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think you can meet him whenever you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.61,0:07:32.23,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My spirit body...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.37,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.25,0:07:35.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.17,0:07:37.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that your power?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder you could steal the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.53,0:07:44.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.81,0:07:46.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.63,0:07:47.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.28,0:07:49.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.78,0:07:50.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.78,0:07:51.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.58,0:07:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.22,0:07:53.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.57,0:07:54.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take Xiaohei too.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.05,0:07:57.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.10,0:07:58.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At worst I'll reveal myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you won't give it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.25,0:08:04.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've told you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao suggested it.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.73,0:08:11.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this all you can?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.73,0:08:12.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I waited for a chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.03,0:08:18.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My well!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.87,0:08:20.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My vegetables!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.95,0:08:23.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:23.98,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\pos(648,74)}Hidden money
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:23.98,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,114)}{\fnAlegreya Sans Black\fs88}↘
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.88,0:08:38.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine tea.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.48,0:08:39.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.47,0:08:42.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.14,0:08:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.97,0:08:45.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the right time to mock me.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.54,0:08:46.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.49,0:08:48.75,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.48,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he hiding his strength?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.90,0:08:51.52,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll get him!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.14,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't take it seriously!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.33,0:08:53.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.31,0:08:58.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm about to be at advantage.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.85,0:08:59.57,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you see at all?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.56,0:09:02.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's make a bet that...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.54,0:09:04.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.57,0:09:06.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.26,0:09:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.37,0:09:08.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.70,0:09:09.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sought shelter.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.90,0:09:10.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.79,0:09:11.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're pausing.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.71,0:09:12.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I hate rain.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't stop a fight halfway!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can fight inside as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's bad for your health to stand in the rain.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.52,0:09:23.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax and have some tea!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.54,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did we end up like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.68,0:09:49.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can the rain fall so hard?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.35,0:09:51.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Piyu...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.35,0:09:53.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be, he's safe where he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.79,0:09:54.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ice boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.64,0:09:55.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not "ice boy".
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of thunder?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.02,0:10:00.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.27,0:10:02.69,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,6 miles away a human got trapped under a collapsed building.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.69,0:10:03.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In which direction?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In front of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.35,0:10:05.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A pavilion!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must help!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.76,0:10:09.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.62,0:10:15.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a spirit?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.16,0:10:16.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't look like you're evil.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.22,0:10:25.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.49,0:10:26.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.84,0:10:29.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting is a mythical spirit beast.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.09,0:10:29.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.89,0:10:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you must be a good spirit.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.49,0:10:32.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why did you attack Gen?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid, knowing what I am?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.00,0:10:37.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not. Gen is a spirit too.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.97,0:10:39.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You actually knew it...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not afraid of him?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.95,0:10:43.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why should I be? He's my cousin!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.27,0:10:45.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you also know that...?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.28,0:11:00.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ice breaking fire!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.77,0:11:03.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No time for this...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.13,0:11:11.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the person?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.33,0:11:12.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was he washed away?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.76,0:11:13.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.25,0:11:20.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you make the ice breaking fire to test me?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.03,0:11:21.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.02,0:11:22.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have rescued the human.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.82,0:11:27.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No secret is safe from you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you find it out?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.48,0:11:31.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We simply know each other too well.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you reveal yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.70,0:11:36.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I live in seclusion now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.21,0:11:44.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao's magical sound transmitter.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.37,0:11:46.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he that modern?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.93,0:11:49.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.68,0:11:52.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.68,0:11:55.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meow.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.01,0:11:57.07,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meow you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.34,0:11:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao wants to see you two.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.53,0:12:01.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.69,0:12:03.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not after me, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.58,0:12:05.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. It's about the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.02,0:12:08.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He realized it finally?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will see when we're there.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're in fact friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were just teasing each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seemed quite serious to us...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.01,0:12:29.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you were hit so hard you flew away.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.49,0:12:31.44,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were after me?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.81,0:12:32.56,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.97,0:12:33.92,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it for nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.52,0:12:35.65,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a victim too.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.97,0:12:40.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you will meet an immortal...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.47,0:12:42.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I go?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.07,0:12:43.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.93,0:12:45.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao will be glad to have company.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I take Xiaohei too?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.53,0:12:51.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.39,0:12:52.59,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to tell her why.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.28,0:12:54.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when do we leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's survive tonight first...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so happy...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.29,0:14:33.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It stopped at last...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.84,0:14:35.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the flood won't go away for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like this every year, we're used to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.34,0:14:39.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.51,0:14:42.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can go to Uncle San's place.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please get Master Lao's sign for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like him that much?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.32,0:14:49.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.72,0:14:50.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do we get there?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.31,0:14:53.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking us.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.18,0:14:56.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.68,0:14:57.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I knew this, I would have taken a ride...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.92,0:15:03.80,Episode title 10,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(418,654)}Master Lao
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.10,0:15:22.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this Master Lao the philosopher Laozi?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.16,0:15:23.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least he was modeled on him.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.56,0:15:25.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not exactly like in the legends.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.99,0:15:28.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And is he powerful?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.56,0:15:29.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.94,0:15:31.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where does he live?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not far from here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.75,0:15:33.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.99,0:15:54.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.25,0:16:06.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.94,0:16:07.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.18,0:16:08.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.35,0:16:11.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.43,0:16:33.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.63,0:16:35.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao's mystical realm.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.38,0:16:37.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Blue Creek Town.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.21,0:16:41.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.14,0:16:50.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The sky is so white!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.25,0:16:54.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this where the immortal lives?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.15,0:16:56.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.25,0:16:57.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.45,0:17:01.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like where an immortal lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.36,0:17:02.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More like an ancient town.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.05,0:17:15.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet here...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.87,0:17:17.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is anyone living here at all?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.02,0:17:18.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one's been here for a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's such a beautiful place...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.01,0:17:28.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao will be glad you like it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got to the gate!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will we leave the town now?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.49,0:17:52.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.44,0:17:54.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the Starry Night Lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.29,0:17:56.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stirry Light Lake?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.49,0:17:57.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come it's night here?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.01,0:18:02.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no real day or night here.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.07,0:18:03.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all controlled by Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you see that mountain ahead?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Mount Laojun.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.95,0:18:08.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao lives on the top.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.96,0:18:14.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two cliffs are statues!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the "Got Light?" cliff.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.13,0:18:18.96,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,It depicts the chance meeting of Master Lao and Fairy Qingning.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.31,0:18:20.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.33,0:18:21.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How romantic!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Books everywhere...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.45,0:18:42.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Lao hasn't left this place for 30 years.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.49,0:18:44.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a stay-at-home.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.64,0:18:48.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's he doing for 30 years in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.74,0:18:50.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's watching anime.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.37,0:18:53.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have come finally!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.10,0:18:55.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good day to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.47,0:18:57.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xuanli!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.52,0:18:59.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a rare occasion you come to my place.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.33,0:19:04.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.76,0:19:07.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you Laozi?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.61,0:19:10.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me you look like a child.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.53,0:19:11.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my economy mode.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.14,0:19:13.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your clothes don't fit you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's more comfortable.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.52,0:19:16.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your voice doesn't fit you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.89,0:19:18.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My voice is just like I want :P
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.52,0:19:21.37,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But I must maintain the image of a venerable wise man.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's already gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ever go out?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.35,0:19:28.40,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,I have sworn not to leave this place for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.48,0:19:30.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.69,0:19:35.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to talk about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.69,0:19:37.41,Main Dialogue,,0,30,0,,{\an3}Many years ago, {\c&Hd7d7d7&}a certain tragic event...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.99,0:19:37.41,Main Dialogue,,30,0,0,,{\an1}It's fine then.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.71,0:19:40.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.71,0:19:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master, would you please sign this?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.90,0:19:43.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.32,0:19:47.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Claim for damages caused by fighting?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's... not what it seems like!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.82,0:19:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just talk about our business.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.28,0:19:55.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us go to the inner room.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.23,0:19:57.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, wait for us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.23,0:19:58.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.57,0:20:07.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for causing you trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.79,0:20:09.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting, it's your fault!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.79,0:20:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of my damn business.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.92,0:20:11.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.85,0:20:13.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you're so polite...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would take long to tell.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.15,0:20:18.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then say it quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.11,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,400 years ago I placed\Nthe Sky Pearl on top of the tower,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.11,0:20:22.87,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,and swore that if someone can steal it, they can take it,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.12,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,or bring it back,\Nand then I grant them a wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.21,0:20:25.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.31,0:20:26.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this happened.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got it all?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.50,Main Dialogue,,30,0,0,,{\an1}Then why did I chase him?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.50,Animal Dialogue,,0,30,0,,{\an3}Then why did he chase me?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.62,0:20:29.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot about my vow.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.16,0:20:31.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.97,0:20:35.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As the only one who could steal it in 400 years,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.77,0:20:37.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you must be a wielder of great skills.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.13,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were careless.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.47,0:20:39.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might be true.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.50,0:20:42.98,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But still, it couldn't have been easy for you to escape Diting.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.13,0:20:45.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, do you choose the Pearl or the wish?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.91,0:20:50.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can they really sense it?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.23,0:20:52.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.22,0:20:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can defeat him...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just do your job.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.20,0:21:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us go ahead.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.00,0:21:06.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's very fast!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.10,0:21:07.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.55,0:21:11.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.59,0:21:14.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.81,0:21:18.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no one can stop us anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.60,0:21:24.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all otaku stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.33,0:21:32.71,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:37.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:42.15,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:48.35,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:54.50,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:59.30,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:03.98,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:10.50,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:21.82,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:27.24,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:32.28,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:43.51,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:49.06,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:55.90,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
